# Airbnb clone take-home

## Reference

- Visual and behavioral source of truth: https://airbnb-clone-umber-two.vercel.app (desktop **1920×1080** only).
- Do **not** copy or lift source code from the reference deployment. Implement original React/Tailwind code.

## Stack conventions

- Monorepo: `apps/web` (Vite React 19, Tailwind v4, Lucide, Plus Jakarta Sans), `apps/api` (Express), `packages/shared`, `fixtures/listing.json`.
- Overlay URLs: `?modal=PHOTO_TOUR_SCROLLABLE` and `?modal=PHOTO_TOUR_SCROLLABLE&modalItem=<photoId>`.
- Escape closes lightbox → tour → listing (single history step per press); arrow keys in lightbox only.

## Quality bar

- Match layout tokens: 1120px content column, 372px booking card, tour shell ~1024px.
- Overlays: focus trap, inert background, enter/exit motion, `aria-modal` dialogs.
- Run `npm run build`, `npm test`, and `npm run lint` before claiming work is done.

## Deliverables in repo

- `docs/architecture.md` + exported diagram PNG for submission zip.
- `PROMPTS.md` — chronological AI prompt log (sanitized).
- `.cursor/rules/` — project guidance (this file).
